>
> 讨论 property 如何把属性访问路由到函数。 （原文要点：``` # Rebinds: name = property(name) When run, the decorated method is automatically passed to the first argument of the property built-in.） 讨论 property 如何把属性访问路由到函数。 （原文要点：This is really just alternative syntax for creating a property and rebinding the attribute name manually, but may be seen as more explicit in this role: ```pyt…）
>
> 讨论 property 如何把属性访问路由到函数；对比装饰器与元类/属性工具。 （原文要点：``` # Manual equivalent to @property Setter and deleter decorators The preceding works naturally for property get functions, but what about other accesses?） 讨论 property 如何把属性访问路由到函数。 （原文要点：In full detail, property objects also have getter, setter, and deleter methods that assign the corresponding property accessor methods and return a copy of the…） 讨论 property 如何把属性访问路由到函数。 （原文要点：We can use these to specify components of properties by decorating normal methods, too, though the getter component (along with attributes docs) is usually fil…）
>
> Example 38-3 demos the basics.
>
> prop-person-deco.py ```python
>
> 'name property docs'print('fetch...') return self._name
>
> 讨论 property 如何把属性访问路由到函数；梳理继承查找路径。 （原文要点：``` del self._name ```python sue = Person('Sue Jones') ``` # sue has a managed attribute ```python print(sue.name) ``` # Runs name getter (def name 1) ```pytho…） When it’s run, the results are the same: ```python $ python3 prop-person-deco.py ``` fetch... Sue Jones change... fetch...
>
