### 代码分析

从原文整理的代表性代码（完整上下文见英文原文）：

```python
class Name:
```

```python
def __get__(self, instance, owner):
print('fetch...')
return instance._name
def __set__(self, instance, value):
print('change...')
```

```python
def __delete__(self, instance):
print('remove...')
```

```python
class Person:
def __init__(self, name):
self._name = name
name = Name()
```

```python
class Super:
def __init__(self, name):
self._name = name
name = Name()
class Person(Super):
```

