>
> ``` # Each desc has own state ```python self.value = start
>
> ``` # On attr fetch ```python return self.value ** 2
>
> ``` # On attr assign ```python self.value = value ``` # No delete or docs ```python
>
> ``` # Assign 描述符（descriptor） 实例 to class attr ```python
