> 讨论 property 如何把属性访问路由到函数；讨论描述符协议及其与 property/slots 的关系。 （原文要点：``` # Another instance in another client class # Could also code two instances in same class ```python c1 = Client1() c2 = Client2() print(c1.X) ``` # 3 ** 2 `…）
