> 讨论描述符协议及其与 property/slots 的关系。 （原文要点：Whether you should access these this way probably varies per program— properties and descriptors may run arbitrary computation and may be less obviously instan…）
>
> I.__dict__ ``` {'data': 'HACK'} ```python
