## 38.27 Chapter Summary（本章小结）

### 英文原文

> This chapter covered the various techniques for managing access to attributes in Python, including the __getattr__ and __getattribute__ operatoroverloading methods, and class properties and descriptors. Along the way, it compared and contrasted these tools and presented a handful of use cases to demonstrate their behavior.
>
> Chapter 39 continues our tool-building focus with a survey of decorators —code run automatically at function and class creation time rather than on attribute access. Before we continue, though, let’s work through a set of questions to review what we’ve covered here.

### 中文翻译

> 本章梳理了 Python 中托管属性访问的主要工具：`property`、描述符、`__getattr__`/`__setattr__`、`__getattribute__`。它们都能在访问时插入代码，但触发条件、作用范围与复杂度不同。作为工具构建者，应按需求选型；作为应用程序员，读懂它们有助于理解框架与标准库中的属性魔法。

### 深度理解

- **核心概念**：能说清四种机制的触发条件与优先级，比背 API 签名更重要。
- 练习：同一字段分别用 property 与描述符实现校验，比较代码量。
- 下一章装饰器、再下一章元类，都会假设你熟悉本章的属性协议。

